OL,3,GNEWSATourism in city tops #1bn for
OL,4,Afirst time
OL,5,
OL,6,FTourism bosses in Coventry say a
OL,7,Flandmark year for the city has seen
OL,8,Fvisitor spending generate more than
OL,9,F#1bn in economic value for the first
OL,10,Ftime.
OL,12,FNew figures show 12.6 million people
OL,13,Fvisited the city in 2025, up 6.5% on
OL,14,Fthe previous year.
OL,16,FDestination Coventry said the growth
OL,17,Fcoincided with a year that included
OL,18,Fpart of Coventry City's
OL,19,FChampionship-winning season and major
OL,20,Fconcerts at the CBS Arena featuring Ed
OL,21,FSheeran, Bob Dylan and Tom Grennan.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,355,350,200,160,0,100
